 "name_en": "Employee Integration – SAP S/4HANA Enablement (1FD)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Employee Integration – SAP S/4HANA Enablement (1FD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio9b8a601768a24ca8b508c40315de46ae\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9b8a601768a24ca8b508c40315de46ae__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> for the employee master data integration to SAP SuccessFactors Employee Central. It can also support the integration of a third-party human resources system. Required tables and data fields can store transferred employees and employee-related data, including organizational data and assigned cost centers.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item does not cover business configuration for HR processes and does not set up integration.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9b8a601768a24ca8b508c40315de46ae__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and store employee data in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> out of transferred data from SAP SuccessFactors Employee Central or a non-SAP HCM system</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9b8a601768a24ca8b508c40315de46ae__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the configuration of <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> HCM tables to store employee and employee-related data transferred from SAP SuccessFactors Employee Central or a non-SAP HCM system</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>员工集成 – SAP S/4HANA 启用 (1FD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio9b8a601768a24ca8b508c40315de46ae\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9b8a601768a24ca8b508c40315de46ae__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 将员工主数据集成到 SAP SuccessFactors Employee Central。它还可以支持第三方人力资源系统的集成。所需表和数据字段可以存储传输的员工和员工相关数据，包括组织数据和分配的成本中心。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目不涵盖 HR 流程的业务配置，也不设置集成。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9b8a601768a24ca8b508c40315de46ae__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">根据从 SAP SuccessFactors Employee Central 或非 SAP HCM 系统传输的数据，在 SAP <span class=\"ph pname\">S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中创建和存储员工数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9b8a601768a24ca8b508c40315de46ae__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">自动配置 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> HCM 表，以存储从 SAP SuccessFactors Employee Central 或非 SAP HCM 系统传输的员工和员工相关数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
